    <string name="settings">Settings</string>
    <string name="s_short_video">Block short videos</string>
    <string name="s_short_video_d">Closes Reels, Shorts and TikTok feeds. The rest of each app keeps working.</string>
    <string name="s_shade">Lock notification shade</string>
    <string name="s_shade_d">During a timer, the shade closes when you pull it down. Wi Fi and data stay as they are, but you cannot reach their buttons.</string>
    <string name="s_strict">Strict Mode</string>
    <string name="s_strict_d">New timers cannot be ended early, and Pixelock cannot be removed or turned off until the timer ends.</string>
    <string name="s_strict_confirm_t">Turn on Strict Mode?</string>
    <string name="s_strict_confirm">Once a timer starts, you cannot end it early. You cannot remove or turn off Pixelock until it ends. A timer running now locks too. Calls, messages, maps and emergency apps always stay open.</string>
